      "text": "Pericarditis:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " colchicine (eg, 0.5 or 0.6 mg once or twice daily) with aspirin or another NSAID; 3 months as an adjunct significantly cuts recurrence and symptom persistence after a first episode."
     }
    ]
